<td id="A4.T1.3.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.7.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">27.5h</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.7.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">67.6</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.7.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">27.0</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T1.3.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T1.3.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">RSGAR (<math id="A4.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=1</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.8.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">57.9h</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.8.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">68.5</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T1.3.8.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">27.4</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T1.3.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T1.3.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b"><span id="A4.T1.3.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">RSGAR (<math id="A4.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=5</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b"><span id="A4.T1.3.9.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">174.5h</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b"><span id="A4.T1.3.9.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">69.8</span></td>
<td id="A4.T1.3.9.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b"><span id="A4.T1.3.9.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">28.1</span></td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table A1: </span>Efficiency analysis. <math id="A4.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> is the time taken by each method to perform one validation on SpatiaLQA.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The results in <a href="#A4.T1" title="In Appendix D Efficiency Analysis ‣ SpatiaLQA: A Benchmark for Evaluating Spatial Logical Reasoning in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A1</span></a> show that although RSGAR requires longer inference time, it achieves better performance than the other baselines. This is because RSGAR is task-oriented and progressively transforms the original image into an interpretable scene graph, providing the VLM with additional information during the reasoning phase, thereby improving overall performance.</p>
</div>
</section>
</article>
